  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nCFWL_PushButton object use-after-free in function CFWL_PushButton::OnKeyDown.  \n  \n**VERSION**   \nOperating System: Windows 10 64bit  \nChrome with enabled XFA PDFium  \n  \n**REPRODUCTION CASE**   \nOpen file `poc.pdf` in `chrome.exe` with PageHeap is enabled.  \nClick left"
